{"id":"53a60483631f158b","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-php-resolution-lower.md","title":"Exponential Lower Bound for PHP in Resolution","display":"thm-php-resolution-lower — Exponential Lower Bound for PHP in Resolution","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-php-resolution-lower","aliases":["72-thm-php-resolution-lower"],"display":"thm-php-resolution-lower — Exponential Lower Bound for PHP in Resolution","depends_on":["[[72-df-resolution-system]]"],"source_location":"Buss and Turan, author manuscript February 1988, sections 2-3, Theorem 1; manuscript/PDF pp. 2-6; Handbook VIII 607-612 remains historical background","source_statement_status":"strong-line-bound-checked-against-primary-Buss-Turan; Haken-original-fulltext-not-read","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"external_source":"https://mathweb.ucsd.edu/~sbuss/ResearchWeb/WPHP/paper.pdf","source_proof_status":"source-proof-not-fully-checked; primary proof read; direct asymptotic specialization checked","round2_verification_status":"source-statement-checked; primary-proof-scope-limited","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; primary-proof-scope-limited"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-php-resolution-lower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-php-resolution-lower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-php-resolution-lower — Exponential Lower Bound for PHP in Resolution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Buss and Turan, author manuscript February 1988, sections 2-3, Theorem 1; manuscript/PDF pp. 2-6; Handbook VIII 607-612 remains historical background"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"strong-line-bound-checked-against-primary-Buss-Turan; Haken-original-fulltext-not-read"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"external_source","html":"<a href=\"https://mathweb.ucsd.edu/~sbuss/ResearchWeb/WPHP/paper.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://mathweb.ucsd.edu/~sbuss/ResearchWeb/WPHP/paper.pdf</a>"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-not-fully-checked; primary proof read; direct asymptotic specialization checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; primary-proof-scope-limited"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; primary-proof-scope-limited"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{i,j}\">\\(p_{i,j}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq i\\leq n+1,\\ 1\\leq j\\leq n\">\\(1\\leq i\\leq n+1,\\ 1\\leq j\\leq n\\)</span>）为两两不同的命题变量；下列集合为通常的非单射鸽巢原理之否定 CNF。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Clause}\">\\(\\mathsf{Clause}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}\">\\(\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_0\\in\\omega\">\\(n_0\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n\\)</span> 是 Assertion 定义的有限子句集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n=\n\\bigl\\{\\{p_{i,1},\\ldots,p_{i,n}\\}:1\\leq i\\leq n+1\\bigr\\}\n\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{\\neg p_{i,j},\\neg p_{i&#39;,j}\\}:1\\leq i&lt;i&#39;\\leq n+1,\\ 1\\leq j\\leq n\\bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n=\n\\bigl\\{\\{p_{i,1},\\ldots,p_{i,n}\\}:1\\leq i\\leq n+1\\bigr\\}\n\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{\\neg p_{i,j},\\neg p_{i&#39;,j}\\}:1\\leq i&lt;i&#39;\\leq n+1,\\ 1\\leq j\\leq n\\bigr\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq\\max(1,n_0)\\;\n\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq2^{cn}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq\\max(1,n_0)\\;\n\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq2^{cn}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>强度与行数度量现有一手来源：Buss–Turán，Resolution Proofs of Generalized Pigeonhole Principles，作者稿（February 1988），§2–§3，稿页/PDF 页 2–6，<a href=\"https://mathweb.ucsd.edu/~sbuss/ResearchWeb/WPHP/paper.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">作者 PDF</a>。§2 的两类子句与本式一致，Thm.1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1/2)(3/2)^{n^2/(50m)}\">\\((1/2)(3/2)^{n^2/(50m)}\\)</span>，并明确 length 为行数。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=n+1\">\\(m=n+1\\)</span> 即推出所需结论。</li>\n<li>接续复核读到作者稿 Lemmas 2–3 及计数证明；本次完整独立验证的是从其 Theorem 1 到本陈述的推导：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^2/(n+1)\\geq n/2\">\\(n^2/(n+1)\\geq n/2\\)</span>，故行数至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tfrac12(3/2)^{n/100}\">\\(\\tfrac12(3/2)^{n/100}\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=\\log_2(3/2)/200\">\\(c=\\log_2(3/2)/200\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_0=400\">\\(n_0=400\\)</span>，便有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tfrac12(3/2)^{n/100}\\geq2^{cn}\">\\(\\tfrac12(3/2)^{n/100}\\geq2^{cn}\\)</span>。没有把作者对全部组合计数及取整细节的证明阅读升级为独立完整证明核验。</li>\n<li>保留历史限制：Haken [1985] 原论文未取得全文；现在支撑数学结论的是上述作者一手后续证明，不再把书中较弱 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^{1/3}\">\\(n^{1/3}\\)</span> 下界误作强下界的依据。书内的 onto+functional 变体另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0bef01f8f19e158b\" href=\"?note=0bef01f8f19e158b\" title=\"72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower\">72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Clause}$、$\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]；$c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$，$n_0\\in\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower","status":"resolved","id":"0bef01f8f19e158b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"保留历史限制：Haken [1985] 原论文未取得全文；现在支撑数学结论的是上述作者一手后续证明，不再把书中较弱 $n^{1/3}$ 下界误作强下界的依据。书内的 onto+functional 变体另见 [[72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"p_{i,j}","display":false},{"tex":"1\\leq i\\leq n+1,\\ 1\\leq j\\leq n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Clause}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"n_0\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n=\n\\bigl\\{\\{p_{i,1},\\ldots,p_{i,n}\\}:1\\leq i\\leq n+1\\bigr\\}\n\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{\\neg p_{i,j},\\neg p_{i',j}\\}:1\\leq i<i'\\leq n+1,\\ 1\\leq j\\leq n\\bigr\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq\\max(1,n_0)\\;\n\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq2^{cn}.","display":true},{"tex":"(1/2)(3/2)^{n^2/(50m)}","display":false},{"tex":"m=n+1","display":false},{"tex":"n^2/(n+1)\\geq n/2","display":false},{"tex":"\\tfrac12(3/2)^{n/100}","display":false},{"tex":"c=\\log_2(3/2)/200","display":false},{"tex":"n_0=400","display":false},{"tex":"\\tfrac12(3/2)^{n/100}\\geq2^{cn}","display":false},{"tex":"n^{1/3}","display":false}],"bytes":2804,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-251","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-php-resolution-lower|thm-php-resolution-lower — Exponential Lower Bound for PHP in Resolution]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-251","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-php-resolution-lower|thm-php-resolution-lower — Exponential Lower Bound for PHP in Resolution]]"},{"id":"0bef01f8f19e158b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s_{\\mathrm{Res}}$、$\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 及固定编码如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]；通常 PHP 子句集合 $\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n$ 如 [[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]，这里只复用该节点的显式 CNF 定义，不使用其强下界的证明。"},{"id":"bab5de7961748d5b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n$ 及其中由 Buss–Turán 一手证明支撑的强下界如 [[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]"}],"outgoing":["e585861c4ee3b135","0bef01f8f19e158b"]}